":"hsk3","hanzi":"詹天佑修京张铁路","titlePinyin":"Zhān Tiānyòu xiū Jīng-Zhāng tiělù","title":{"fr":"Zhan Tianyou et le chemin de fer Pékin–Zhangjiakou","en":"Zhan Tianyou and the Beijing–Zhangjiakou Railway"},"era":{"fr":"1861 – 1919","en":"1861 – 1919"},"summary":{"fr":"À 11 ans, il part étudier en Amérique. Quand la Chine veut construire son premier chemin de fer de montagne sans aide étrangère, les étrangers rient : « L'ingénieur chinois qui pourra le faire n'est pas encore né. » Il leur répond par un train.","en":"At 11 he leaves to study in America. When China wants to build its first mountain railway without foreign help, foreigners laugh: “The Chinese engineer who can do it hasn't been born yet.” He answers with a train."},"chars":1961}